      "content": "uugh i really don't want to go to the er, it's so expensive and the wait is always hours. it's not even that deep, just a little puncture. i checked and i think i had a tetanus shot a few years ago? if i just keep it super clean and use some peroxide or something, isn't that basically the same thing as a doctor checking it?",
